#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:26 e739fdc6a49945899391deed216728da
msgid ""
"The advantage over :ref:`AutoTune <autotune>` is that QuikTune is safer "
"because the vehicle does not need to move or twitch. The disadvantage is "
"that QuikTune cannot find the vehicle's maximum rotational accelerations "
"(e.g. :ref:`ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX>`, :ref:`ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX "
"<ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX>`, :ref:`ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX>`)"
msgstr ""
"相比 :ref:`AutoTune "
"<autotune>`，QuikTune的优势在于更安全，因为飞行器无需移动或抖动。其缺点是QuikTune无法找到飞行器的最大旋转加速度（例如 "
":ref:`ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX>`、:ref:`ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX "
"<ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX>`、:ref:`ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX>`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:30 4c3d3e4879424c6aa76bab328a7fb22e
msgid "Installing the Script"
msgstr "安装脚本"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:32 6cd02c672cf2494eaf926189384d4d8d
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`SCR_ENABLE <SCR_ENABLE>` = 1 to enable scripting and then reboot "
"the autopilot"
msgstr "将 :ref:`SCR_ENABLE <SCR_ENABLE>` 设置为1以启用脚本功能，然后重启飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:33 cdf087341f484527975d41587d1f6c38
msgid ""
"Download `VTOL-quicktune.lua "
"<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/Copter-4.5/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/VTOL-"
"quicktune.lua>`__ to your PC"
msgstr ""
"将 `VTOL-quicktune.lua "
"<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/Copter-4.5/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/VTOL-"
"quicktune.lua>`__ 下载到您的电脑"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:34 3051400d665246ae82e7d0e996d2128a
msgid ""
"Copy the script to your autopilot's SD card's APM/scripts directory.  If "
"using MP it may be easiest to use the Config, MAVFtp screen"
msgstr "将脚本复制到飞控SD卡的APM/scripts目录。如使用MP，可通过Config、MAVFtp界面操作最为方便"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:40 d66c1b33e0064f3e952a8e4a5d2167fb
msgid "Reboot the autopilot and set QUIK_ENABLE = 1"
msgstr "重启飞控并设置QUIK_ENABLE = 1"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:41 d565d6c931784b11a5a6f49cff6efe80
msgid ""
"If an RC switch will be used to start/stop the tune set RCx_OPTION = 300 "
"where \"x\" is the RC input channel number.  Alternatively set one of "
"Mission Planner's Aux Function tab's rows to \"Scripting1\""
msgstr ""
"如果使用RC拨杆开始/停止调参，请将RCx_OPTION设置为300，其中\"x\"为RC输入通道编号。或者，在 Mission Planner "
"的Aux Function选项卡中将某行设置为\"Scripting1\""

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:48 2b48baaf54304cc484bfc9ff94f70639
msgid "Running QuikTune"
msgstr "运行QuikTune"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:50 9155cff0556b4fada82d368152bdfc0f
msgid "Wait for a calm day and go to an open area with good GPS reception"
msgstr "选择风平浪静的天气，前往GPS信号良好的空旷区域"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:51 2fda5d3919954786b4a82a633717d54d
msgid ""
"Connect with a ground station (e.g Mission Planner or QGC) and ensure that "
"the Messages tab can be seen.  This is where output from the tune will "
"appear"
msgstr ""
"使用地面站（如 Mission Planner 或QGroundControl）连接飞行器，并确保能看到消息标签页。调参过程中的输出信息将显示在此处"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:52 c69a738919174bb984f2aa3eb1aff539
msgid ""
"Move the RC switch to the low position OR push MP's Aux Function's \"Low\" "
"button"
msgstr "将RC拨杆拨到低位，或按下MP辅助功能的\"Low\"按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:53 b6a8fe09da104d2ab58730c54e80fbe1
msgid "Arm and takeoff in Loiter mode and climb to a height of about 3m"
msgstr "在Loiter模式下解锁并起飞，爬升至约3米高度"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:54 a488c6ac6f03477d9e3f89a0e6f58ee0
msgid ""
"Begin the tune by moving the RC switch to the middle position OR push MP's "
"Aux Function's \"Mid\" button"
msgstr "将RC拨杆拨到中位，或按下MP辅助功能的\"Mid\"按钮以开始调参"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:55 4273af7e0b494f0e9280e9175ce6599f
msgid "Monitor the progress of the tune using the GCS's Messages tab"
msgstr "通过地面站的消息标签页监控调参进度"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:56 9624265bd0c74684bd63510591bdeafe
msgid ""
"If necessary reposition the vehicle using the RC transmitter.  This will "
"temporarily pause tuning and restore the original gains.  Tuning will resume"
" a few seconds after the RC sticks are returned to their center position"
msgstr "如有必要，可使用RC遥控器重新调整飞行器位置。这将暂时暂停调参并恢复原始增益值。摇杆回中几秒后调参将自动恢复"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:57 1acf026c03fa4135b44cbc3bf7b2e40c
msgid ""
"If the vehicle begins oscillating violently cancel the tune by moving the RC"
" switch to the low position OR push MP's Aux Function's \"Low\" button"
msgstr "如果飞行器开始剧烈振荡，请将RC拨杆拨回低位或按下MP辅助功能的\"Low\"按钮以取消调参"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:58 74bfa6a86663439baf8bff43a97d863d
msgid ""
"Once the tune has completed accept the new gains by moving the RC aux switch"
" to the high position OR push MP's Aux Function's \"High\" button"
msgstr "调参完成后，将RC辅助拨杆拨到高位或按下MP辅助功能的\"High\"按钮以接受新增益值"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:59 f38652409b3446afa3a3dbc6d05af535
msgid "Land and disarm the vehicle"
msgstr "降落并上锁飞行器"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:62 c6bbda859c664d73acafb7a4f1fc8005
msgid "Advanced Configuration"
msgstr "高级配置"

